Portability stays in the application


Mistral direct
One Mistral model wins on the labeled rubric
Direct provider relationship
The application owns retries and normalization


Groq direct
One Groq-backed choice wins the workload test
Direct provider path
Validate correctness before optimizing handling


LiteLLM gateway
The team wants a self-hosted multi-provider boundary
Open-source gateway under team control
